    "text": "Let $\\ell(N)$ be maximal such that in any finite set $A\\subset \\mathbb{R}$ of size $N$ there exists a Sidon subset $S$ of size $\\ell(N)$ (i.e. the only solutions to $a+b=c+d$ in $S$ are the trivial ones). Determine the order of $\\ell(N)$.",
